      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `speech_client.py` file, I need to include the necessary imports for the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API and define a client helper utility. The Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API is a concrete third-party managed service, and I will use the `google-cloud-speech` Python package to interact with it. </thinking>\n\n",
