    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `stream_with_language.py` that starts a streaming recognizer with language and punctuation settings, I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API. This API is a concrete external provider that can be identified in the code through the import of the `google.cloud.speech` module and the use of the `SpeechClient` class. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789859553451,
          "start": 1789859550217
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf15409001tIYpnF5olgKbvc",
