        "text": "<thinking> To handle partial and final streaming recognition events, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. I will choose Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API for this task as it provides streaming recognition capabilities. I will write the code to import the necessary library, set up the client, and handle streaming recognition events. </thinking>\n",
